# sort and top without by (DS0121, with a fix). The keys still parse.
mode: syntax
---- query
from t | sort x desc | top 3 x
---- expected
PROGRAM@0..31
  PIPELINE@0..30
    IDENT@0..4 "from"
    WHITESPACE@4..5 " "
    NAME_REF@5..6
      IDENT@5..6 "t"
    WHITESPACE@6..7 " "
    PIPE@7..8 "|"
    WHITESPACE@8..9 " "
    SORT_OP@9..20
      IDENT@9..13 "sort"
      WHITESPACE@13..14 " "
      SORT_KEY@14..20
        NAME_REF@14..15
          IDENT@14..15 "x"
        WHITESPACE@15..16 " "
        IDENT@16..20 "desc"
    WHITESPACE@20..21 " "
    PIPE@21..22 "|"
    WHITESPACE@22..23 " "
    TOP_OP@23..30
      IDENT@23..26 "top"
      WHITESPACE@26..27 " "
      LITERAL@27..28
        LONG@27..28 "3"
      WHITESPACE@28..29 " "
      SORT_KEY@29..30
        NAME_REF@29..30
          IDENT@29..30 "x"
  WHITESPACE@30..31 "\n"

error[DS0121]: missing `by` after `sort`
  --> query:1:15
  |
1 | from t | sort x desc | top 3 x
  |               ^ expected `by` before this
  |
  = help: insert `by`: `sort by x desc`

error[DS0121]: missing `by` after `top`
  --> query:1:30
  |
1 | from t | sort x desc | top 3 x
  |                              ^ expected `by` before this
  |
  = help: insert `by`: `top 3 by x`

with the machine-applicable fixes applied:
    from t | sort by x desc | top 3 by x
which parses without errors
